cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark, please cite it as below."
title: "IC-ThermBench: An Open, Progressive Benchmark for Generalizable 2.5D/3D-IC Thermal Learning"
abstract: >-
  An open thermal-learning benchmark with progressive physical support, unified
  splits and metrics, and case-disjoint structural out-of-distribution evaluation.
  The released code evaluates eight convolutional, neural-operator, and PDE
  foundation-model baselines across four generator-backed scopes and supports
  training, evaluation, and few-shot adaptation from one entry point.
authors:
  - name: "The IC-ThermBench Authors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Day333/IC-ThermBench"
